patch.description:
Change homework you set: a key you leave out keeps its value;
due_time null means the end of the day; max_score null makes it
feedback-only. Added students are notified.

get.description:
The discounts, active first, then by kind (scholarship, sibling,
discount, promotion), name and id. `kind` and `status` may be repeated;
`q` matches part of the name, ignoring case.

ApprovalRequestChangesBody.description:
``POST …/request-changes``: what the requester must change (required;
at most 1000 characters once trimmed). A missing reason is a ``422`` on
``reason`` after the ``404`` and ``409`` checks.

AssignmentGradeEntry.description:
One entry of the academic history: a scored homework grade (#82 G1;
closed allow-list: no author id, no submission text or link, no change
reason). Feedback-only grades are not history entries.

BillingSettingsUpdate.description:
``PATCH /api/v1/billing/settings`` (#91 B3). Both keys are required;
``billing_starts_on: null`` turns billing off. Any date from 2000-01-01
to 2099-12-31, past included (``date_out_of_range`` otherwise).

CustomPriceItem.description:
One custom price (#95 E1): for a student or a family (the other is
``null``), from ``effective_from`` to ``expires_on`` (inclusive;
``null`` = open-ended). ``status`` against the center's local today;
``in_use``: a charge was posted at this price (then only ``expires_on``
can change).

FamilyUpdate.description:
A change to a family (``PATCH /api/v1/families/{id}``) with the
``version`` the caller loaded. ``is_active`` deactivates or reactivates;
the members are kept.
